Fresh Farm Vegetables — Professional E-Commerce Website Development Prompt

Project Brief

Act as a senior full-stack e-commerce developer, UI/UX designer, and conversion optimization specialist. Design and build a complete, production-ready e-commerce web application for Fresh Farm Vegetables, a premium fresh vegetable supplier based in DHA Phase 6, Lahore, Pakistan.

Use https://freshbasket.com.pk/ as a reference for the shopping experience, product-grid organization, category navigation, cart interactions, and clean grocery-commerce interface. Create an original design tailored to Fresh Farm Vegetables; do not copy the reference website's branding, exact layouts, text, or proprietary assets.

The website must combine a modern online shopping experience with the business's specialty in iceberg lettuce, vacuum-packed lettuce, local vegetables, imported vegetables, and supply services for restaurants, hotels, cafés, and professional kitchens.

The final result should look like a real, established vegetable supply brand rather than a generic template or an AI-generated mockup.

