Pricing requirements

Because vegetable market rates change daily, implement one of these two supported purchasing modes:

Mode A — Live pricing

An authorized administrator can update product prices and availability. Customers see the most recently published prices, which are clearly maintained in PKR.

Mode B — Request a quote

When a product does not have a confirmed current price, show "Request Today's Rate" instead of a numeric price. Customers can add their requirements to a quote list and send an inquiry.

When a customer requests a quote, include:

Product names

Quantities

Selected package sizes

Customer contact details

Delivery location, if applicable

Additional requirements

The administrator must be able to respond with current pricing before the order is finalized.

Do not silently substitute estimated prices for confirmed market rates.

